# Dotenv files: prettier has no parser for the format, so including them makes
# `npm run format` fail rather than format anything.
.env
.env.*

# Hand-formatted prose and inputs. `prettier --write .` over these rewrapped every docs table and
# every README paragraph and expanded the deliberately one-line fixture package.json files, so the
# formatting command produced a large diff unrelated to whatever change was in hand. Nothing gates
# markdown formatting — CI runs typecheck, lint, and the test suite — so these stay as written and
# `npm run format` is scoped to code, which is what the tooling actually agrees on.
